---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Directed Edges / Nathan Curtis"
  description="Nathan started Directed Edges to serve his clients and community practicing design systems. He's passionate about information architecture, statistics and UX design."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight mb-2">Nathan Curtis</h1>
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted mb-8">Design system consultant</p>

    <p class="text-lg text-muted mb-4">
      Nathan started Directed Edges in 2024 to provide design system expertise to clients and the worldwide community. He's passionate about information architecture and consults with design systems teams to architect solutions, drive strategy and optimize operations.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted mb-4">
      Nathan wrote <a href="https://www.amazon.com/Modular-Web-Design-Components-Documentation/dp/0321601351">Modular Web Design</a> in 2009, authors a well-known <a href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis/lists">design systems blog</a>, and speaks at events worldwide. Prior to starting Directed Edges, Nathan led EightShapes with <a href="https://www.curious-squid.com/">Dan Brown</a> from 2006 to 2024.
    </p>

    <!-- Experience -->
    <section class="my-16">
      <SectionLabel label="Experience" />
      <p class="text-muted">Since 2006, Nathan has consulted with 80+ design system teams. <span class="text-sm">(## indicates months serving as a lead driving the design system program.)</span></p>
    </section>

    <!-- Writing -->
    <section class="my-16">
      <SectionLabel label="Writing" />

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1"><a href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis/lists">Blog (on Medium.com)</a></h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-4">2015 &ndash; present, 2,000,000+ views</p>
        <p class="text-muted mb-3">Browse by category:</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <a href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis/list/design-tokens-and-visual-style-a70978d80056" class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border hover:bg-bg-alt no-underline">Visual Style</a>
          <a href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis/list/ui-components-90c74982dd7e" class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border hover:bg-bg-alt no-underline">UI Components</a>
          <a href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis/list/documentation-840a06090c66" class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border hover:bg-bg-alt no-underline">Documentation</a>
          <a href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis/list/releases-a6203df2a767" class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border hover:bg-bg-alt no-underline">Releases</a>
          <a href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis/list/planning-c9a34f4e0526" class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border hover:bg-bg-alt no-underline">Planning</a>
          <a href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis/list/process-86df670f62c0" class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border hover:bg-bg-alt no-underline">Process</a>
          <a href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis/list/people-teams-627847d004e3" class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border hover:bg-bg-alt no-underline">People and Teams</a>
          <a href="https://medium.com/@nathanacurtis/list/systems-of-systems-c5c4edef3560" class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border hover:bg-bg-alt no-underline">Systems of Systems</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-1"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/Modular-Web-Design-Components-Documentation/dp/0321601351">Modular Web Design</a></h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-2">2009</p>
        <p class="text-muted">A design systems book before &ldquo;design systems.&rdquo; It elaborates on component architecture, how to build libraries and create component and pattern docs using tools of the day.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tools -->
    <section class="my-16">
      <SectionLabel label="Tools" />
      <p class="text-muted mb-6">Nathan has been making and sharing useful design systems tools with community since 2006. Remember EightShapes Unify, the InDesign design docs and specs templates? How about those Adobe Illustrator keyboard shortcuts?</p>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">Recent tools include:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="https://www.specsplugin.com">Specs</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Figma plugin</span></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/1077953882260191737/visual-difference">Visual difference</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Figma plugin</span></li>
        <li><a href="https://contrast-grid.eightshapes.com/">Contrast grid</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Web app</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Appearances -->
    <section class="my-16">
      <SectionLabel label="Appearances" />

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Workshops</h3>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium">Design tokens &amp; UI component architecture</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Conceive, build and support a scalable architecture of configurable and composable design tokens and UI components for a durable library that stands the test of time.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium">Design system planning and process</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Scope, plan and run processes to make features, deliver releases, tackle complex initiatives, and guide an organization through a major new generation of an entire library.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Recent talks</h3>

        <h4 class="font-medium text-sm text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mt-6 mb-3">2024</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="https://smashingconf.com/antwerp-2024/schedule">Managing Design Systems</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; SmashingConf, Antwerp, Belgium, October 2024</span></li>
          <li><a href="https://smashingconf.com/ny-2024/schedule">Managing Design Systems</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; SmashingConf, New York, NY, October 2024</span></li>
          <li><a href="https://zeroheight.com/events/converge/home/">Managing Design Systems</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Converge by ZeroHeight, Brighton, UK, October 2024</span></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.intodesignsystems.com/">Designing and Automating Component Specifications</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Into Design Systems, Online, May 2024</span></li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="font-medium text-sm text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mt-6 mb-3">2023</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="https://webexpo.net/blog/make-designers-fall-in-love-with-your-design-system/">How to make and share more flexible UI components</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; WebExpo, Prague, CZ, April 2023</span></li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="font-medium text-sm text-muted uppercase tracking-wide mt-6 mb-3">2022</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NiDoqI_ZhvY">Architecting subcomponents</a> <span class="text-muted">&mdash; Figma Schema, New York, NY, November 2022</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
